        {
          "info": {
            "name": "AuthoriseReallocation",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": "https://api-prd.aemo.local/ws/NEMWholesale/reallocations/authoriseReallocation",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-initiatingParticipantID",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-market",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "The authoriseReallocation API sets the state of the reallocation to AUTHORISE, signalling that both parties have agreed to the reallocation."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "cancelReallocation",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": "https://api-prd.aemo.local/ws/NEMWholesale/reallocations/cancelReallocation",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-initiatingParticipantID",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-market",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "The cancelReallocation API sets the state of a reallocation to CANCEL, signalling to the Prudential system to exclude the reallocation from processing further."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "getAgreementTypes",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api-prd.aemo.local/ws/NEMWholesale/reallocations/getAgreementTypes",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-initiatingParticipantID",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-market",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": ""
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "The getAgreementTypes API retrieves a list of reallocation agreement types and associated descriptions. Possible values are -\n- $ - Dollar offset, a set dollar value for each interval.\n- MWh – Energy Offset, a set energy quantity for each interval, values at that interval’s RRP.\n- Swap – Swap offset, a quantity and price.\n- Cap – Cap offset, a quantity and price.\n- Floor – Floor offset, a quantity and price."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "getcalendar",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api-prd.aemo.local/ws/NEMWholesale/reallocations/getCalendar",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-initiatingParticipantID",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-market",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "calendarId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Unique identifier of the calendar"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Weekends are implicitly assumed to be non-business days and are not explicitly included in the calendar information returned. The getCalendar API retrieves a list of public holidays from a given calendar. The calendar non-business days are taken from the NEM database."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "getCalendars",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api-prd.aemo.local/ws/NEMWholesale/reallocations/getCalendars",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-initiatingParticipantID",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-market",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "startDate",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Format - date-time (as date-time in RFC3339). Start date of the reallocation"
              },
              {
                "name": "regionId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "endDate",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "The getCalendars API retrieves a list of Calendar IDs and associated descriptive names fulfilling the following criteria-\n- The Calendar is configured for reallocations.\n- If the regionId filter parameter is in the request, there must be at least one calendar entry matching the given region.\n- If the startDate filter parameter is in the request, there must be at least one calendar entry with a calendar date greater than or equal to the start date.\n- If the endDate filter parameter is in the requ"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "getMarketPriceCap",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api-prd.aemo.local/ws/NEMWholesale/reallocations/getMarketPriceCap",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-initiatingParticipantID",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-market",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "effectiveDate",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "The getMarketPriceCap API retrieves the VOLL (Value of Lost Load) price at the given effective date in the request. The specific value retrieved is the one that-\n- Has an effectiveDate value that is the greatest effectiveDate value, less than or equal to the supplied effective date in the request, where the record is authorised.\n- Has a versionNo value that is greater than the versionNo value, for the corresponding effectiveDate value, where the record is authorised."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "getParticipants",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api-prd.aemo.local/ws/NEMWholesale/reallocations/getParticipants",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-initiatingParticipantID",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-market",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": ""
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "The getParticipants API retrieves a list of NEM Participant IDs and associated descriptive names fulfilling the following criteria-\n- Have a participant class of Market Participant.\n- Participants cannot create reallocation requests between participant IDs owned by the same Company ID."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "getProfileTypes",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api-prd.aemo.local/ws/NEMWholesale/reallocations/getProfileTypes",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-initiatingParticipantID",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-market",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": ""
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "The getProfileTypes API retrieves a list of reallocation Day Types and associated descriptions. Possible values are-\n- Flat – everyday including Business and Non-Business days.\n- Business – Business days do not include weekends or public holidays (based on the chosen PH calendar).\n- Non-business – Any day that is not a business day."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "getReallocation",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api-prd.aemo.local/ws/NEMWholesale/reallocations/getReallocation",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-initiatingParticipantID",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-market",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "reallocationId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Retrieves a single reallocation along with its associated properties and reallocation profile data. The reallocationId request parameter is used to retrieve the reallocation matching the supplied ID."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "getReallocations",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api-prd.aemo.local/ws/NEMWholesale/reallocations/getReallocations",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-initiatingParticipantID",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "X-market",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "calendarId",
