          },
          "docs": "The getReallocations API retrieves a list of reallocations and associated properties that fulfil the following criteria-\n  - Either the submittingParticipantId or counterpartyParticipantId property of the reallocation must match the ID of the request participantId.\n  \n  - If the regionId filter parameter is in the request, the regionId property of the reallocation must match the value.\n  \n  - If the startDate filter parameter is in the request, the endDate property of the reallocation must be gr"
        },
        {
